Please, I'm on my knees begging every AI executive on the planet to stop with this stuff. Just give us models and let the collective distributed intelligence of people figure things out in real time like we always do. We don't need societal level surgery, UBI, robot taxes, or ham-fisted legislation. AI is amazing and wonderful, but it's not magic. Can we please let AI be cool and useful in realistic ways instead of all this crazy talk?

We are hallucinating at a collective scale; it's madness. Just give us products and leave the politics behind. Stop proposing drastic measures for things that have not happened and may not happen.

